  triage:closedNote "Fixed on plan/search-indexing-admission-performance (commit b7004f67e, PR #891): sprint-AQ1-durable-idle-search-projection.md:27-33 now names a concrete tracked gate artifact, docs/plans/phase-aq/aq1-schema-approval.md, requiring its approval to be copied into the AQ.1 implementation PR. Artifact exists with a hard checklist (5 items, correctly still unchecked/pending at this planning-only stage). Confirmed independently by req-qa and arch-qa." ;
